    "name": "What Awaits, Aleksey?",
    "steam_appid": 2913610,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913610/extras/1da06b8890277ad183a3afe5d247cbc4.avif?t=1734814322\" width=612 height=201 /></span><br><i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dear Aleksey Lutomski!</h2>Congratulations! Our personnel has positively reviewed your application. We hope you accept this post at the Cipher Bureau and that you'll dutifully serve the Socialist Republic. </i><br><i><br>We will be expecting You in 1 week at 9:00 AM at the Cipher Bureau on <strong>[REDACTED]</strong> Street, floor 4, room 57. Your direct supervisor will be waiting there to provide you with the safety instructions and your first tasks will be assigned to you.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AGENTS OF <i>OKO</i>!</strong></h2>At the Cipher Bureau, you will be appointed with tasks of extraordinary magnitude \u2013 protecting our homeland from external and internal enemies - thereby safeguarding our common heritage and future. You will encounter great challanges on the path of fulfilling Your duty:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Deciphering mysterious messages<br></li><li>Problem solving<br></li><li>Intelilgence gathering<br></li><li>Undercover work<br></li><li>Interrogations<br></li><li>Renouncing personal considerations in favor of Your duty</li></ul><br><strong>Comrades, are you ready to raise the banner of our socialist homeland even higher?</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913610/extras/1da06b8890277ad183a3afe5d247cbc4.avif?t=1734814322\" width=612 height=201 /></span><br><i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dear Aleksey Lutomski!</h2>Congratulations! Our personnel has positively reviewed your application. We hope you accept this post at the Cipher Bureau and that you'll dutifully serve the Socialist Republic. </i><br><i><br>We will be expecting You in 1 week at 9:00 AM at the Cipher Bureau on <strong>[REDACTED]</strong> Street, floor 4, room 57. Your direct supervisor will be waiting there to provide you with the safety instructions and your first tasks will be assigned to you.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AGENTS OF <i>OKO</i>!</strong></h2>At the Cipher Bureau, you will be appointed with tasks of extraordinary magnitude \u2013 protecting our homeland from external and internal enemies - thereby safeguarding our common heritage and future. You will encounter great challanges on the path of fulfilling Your duty:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Deciphering mysterious messages<br></li><li>Problem solving<br></li><li>Intelilgence gathering<br></li><li>Undercover work<br></li><li>Interrogations<br></li><li>Renouncing personal considerations in favor of Your duty</li></ul><br><strong>Comrades, are you ready to raise the banner of our socialist homeland even higher?</strong>",
    "short_description": "Utilize your analytical skills to connect the dots and unveil hidden conspiracies! Join the ranks of the People's Intelligence Bureau as a junior cryptologist, decipher cryptic messages and unravel plots brewed up by enemies of the state. Or . . . decide to save them...?",
